Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.90,0:12:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,警车 警车来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉快逃…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.28,0:12:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 快回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.78,0:12:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,请问…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,仁科小姐的家在哪个方向
